  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development would conflict with Condition 6 of outline planning permission 93/0474/OUT dated 26 May 1993, which stipulates that the garage space must be retained at all times for the accommodation of private motor vehicles. The conversion of the garage into a habitable room would breach this restriction, thereby removing permitted development rights. Consequently, the proposal does not constitute permitted development under Schedule 2, Part 1, Class A of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended), and the operations cannot be certified as lawful."
